        "created_at": "2021-07-27T17:30:43.430Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I’m currently seeing the <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/frowning_face_with_open_mouth.png?v=9\" title=\":frowning_face_with_open_mouth:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":frowning_face_with_open_mouth:\"> emoji as broken. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/frowning.png?v=9\" title=\":frowning:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":frowning:\"> Is anyone else having this issue? It’s the only one I’m having an issue with, so there’s that. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/confused.png?v=9\" title=\":confused:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":confused:\"></p>\n<p>Edit: For clarity, I’m referring to the :<span class=\"bbcode-b\"></span>frowning_face_with_open_mouth<span class=\"bbcode-b\"></span>: emoji.</p>",
